{"seq":3,"slug":"monitoring-and-tuning","title":"系统监控与性能调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/linux-practice/monitoring-and-tuning","wordCount":1061,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"系统监控与性能调优\">系统监控与性能调优</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能调优的第一步是定位瓶颈，而不是盲目调整参数。核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>四大资源维度</strong>：CPU、内存、磁盘 I/O、网络——系统变慢的原因几乎总能归到其中之一，排查顺序即为逐层排除。</li>\n<li><strong>指标先行</strong>：每个维度都有对应的关键指标（CPU 看使用率与负载、内存看缓存与 Swap、磁盘看 await 与 %util、网络看带宽与丢包），工具只是读取指标的手段。</li>\n<li><strong>负载与核数</strong>：Load Average 的绝对值没有意义，必须除以 CPU 核数才有可比性——这是最常见的误判来源。</li>\n<li><strong>可观测性工具链</strong>：top/vmstat/iostat 提供系统级统计，perf 采样 CPU 热点，strace 追踪系统调用，各自覆盖不同的排查层次。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话概括：<strong>先定位瓶颈在哪一维，再用对应工具读取指标，最后才动参数——顺序错了，调优就是随机尝试</strong>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能分析方法论\">性能分析方法论</h2><p>在进行性能调优之前，首先需要确定瓶颈在哪里。系统性能的四大资源维度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU</td>\n<td>使用率、负载、上下文切换</td>\n<td>top, mpstat, perf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存</td>\n<td>使用率、缓存命中率、Swap</td>\n<td>free, vmstat, /proc/meminfo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘 I/O</td>\n<td>IOPS、吞吐量、延迟</td>\n<td>iostat, iotop, blktrace</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络</td>\n<td>带宽、延迟、丢包率</td>\n<td>sar, iftop, ss</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;系统变慢&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;CPU 使用率高？&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[&quot;分析 CPU 热点&lt;br/&gt;perf top&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{&quot;内存不足？&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[&quot;分析内存使用&lt;br/&gt;free, /proc/meminfo&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{&quot;I/O 等待高？&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[&quot;分析磁盘 I/O&lt;br/&gt;iostat, iotop&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[&quot;分析网络&lt;br/&gt;ss, tcpdump&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"系统变慢\"] --&gt; B{\"CPU 使用率高？\"}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[\"分析 CPU 热点&lt;br/&gt;perf top\"]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{\"内存不足？\"}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[\"分析内存使用&lt;br/&gt;free, /proc/meminfo\"]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{\"I/O 等待高？\"}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[\"分析磁盘 I/O&lt;br/&gt;iostat, iotop\"]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[\"分析网络&lt;br/&gt;ss, tcpdump\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"cpu-监控\">CPU 监控</h2><h3 id=\"top-htop\">top / htop</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# top 基本用法&#10;top&#10;&#10;# 按 CPU 排序&#10;top -o %CPU&#10;&#10;# htop（增强版 top）&#10;htop\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># top 基本用法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">top</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按 CPU 排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">top</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> %CPU</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># htop（增强版 top）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">htop</span></span></code></pre></div><p>top 输出的关键字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>us（user）</td>\n<td>用户态 CPU 时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sy（system）</td>\n<td>内核态 CPU 时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ni（nice）</td>\n<td>低优先级进程 CPU 时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>id（idle）</td>\n<td>空闲 CPU 时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>wa（iowait）</td>\n<td>等待 I/O 的 CPU 时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>si/hi</td>\n<td>软中断/硬中断 CPU 时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"负载-load-average\">负载（Load Average）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"uptime&#10;# 08:00:00 up 30 days, load average: 2.50, 1.80, 1.20&#10;#                                     1min  5min  15min\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uptime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 08:00:00 up 30 days, load average: 2.50, 1.80, 1.20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#                                     1min  5min  15min</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>负载值</th>\n<th>含义（单核 CPU）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 1.0</td>\n<td>CPU 空闲</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>= 1.0</td>\n<td>CPU 刚好满载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 1.0</td>\n<td>有任务在排队等待</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>多核系统中，负载值需要除以 CPU 核数来判断。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内存监控\">内存监控</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看内存概况&#10;free -h&#10;&#10;# 详细内存信息&#10;cat /proc/meminfo&#10;&#10;# 虚拟内存统计&#10;vmstat 1 5\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看内存概况</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">free</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 详细内存信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /proc/meminfo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 虚拟内存统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vmstat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span></code></pre></div><p>vmstat 关键字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>r</td>\n<td>等待运行的进程数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>b</td>\n<td>不可中断睡眠的进程数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>swpd</td>\n<td>已用 Swap 大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>free</td>\n<td>空闲内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>buff/cache</td>\n<td>缓冲区和缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>si/so</td>\n<td>Swap 换入/换出速率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"磁盘-i-o-监控\">磁盘 I/O 监控</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# I/O 统计（每秒刷新）&#10;iostat -xz 1&#10;&#10;# 按进程查看 I/O&#10;iotop -oP\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># I/O 统计（每秒刷新）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iostat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -xz</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 按进程查看 I/O</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iotop</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -oP</span></span></code></pre></div><p>iostat 关键字段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>r/s, w/s</td>\n<td>每秒读/写请求数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>rkB/s, wkB/s</td>\n<td>每秒读/写吞吐量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>await</td>\n<td>平均 I/O 响应时间（ms）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>%util</td>\n<td>设备繁忙度（100% 表示饱和）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"perf-性能剖析\">perf — 性能剖析</h2><p>perf 是 Linux 内核自带的性能分析工具，可以采样 CPU 执行热点。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 实时查看 CPU 热点函数&#10;perf top&#10;&#10;# 对进程采样&#10;perf record -g -p &lt;PID&gt; -- sleep 30&#10;&#10;# 查看报告&#10;perf report&#10;&#10;# 统计系统调用&#10;perf stat -e syscalls:sys_enter_* -p &lt;PID&gt; -- sleep 10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 实时查看 CPU 热点函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> top</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 对进程采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> report</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统计系统调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> syscalls:sys_enter_</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"火焰图-flame-graph\">火焰图（Flame Graph）</h3><p>火焰图是 perf 数据的可视化形式，直观展示函数调用栈和 CPU 时间分布。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成火焰图&#10;perf record -g -p &lt;PID&gt; -- sleep 30&#10;perf script &gt; perf.unfold&#10;stackcollapse-perf.pl perf.unfold &gt; perf.folded&#10;flamegraph.pl perf.folded &gt; flamegraph.svg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成火焰图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> perf.unfold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stackcollapse-perf.pl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> perf.unfold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> perf.folded</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flamegraph.pl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> perf.folded</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flamegraph.svg</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"strace-系统调用追踪\">strace — 系统调用追踪</h2><p>strace 跟踪进程的系统调用和信号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 追踪进程的系统调用&#10;strace -p &lt;PID&gt;&#10;&#10;# 追踪命令的系统调用&#10;strace ls -l /tmp&#10;&#10;# 统计系统调用耗时&#10;strace -c -p &lt;PID&gt;&#10;&#10;# 只追踪文件相关调用&#10;strace -e trace=file ls\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 追踪进程的系统调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 追踪命令的系统调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -l</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /tmp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 统计系统调用耗时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PI</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">D</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 只追踪文件相关调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">strace</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> trace=file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>-p PID</td>\n<td>附加到运行中的进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-c</td>\n<td>统计模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-e trace=X</td>\n<td>过滤特定类型（file/network/memory）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-f</td>\n<td>跟踪子进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>-T</td>\n<td>显示每个调用的耗时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sysctl-内核参数调优\">sysctl — 内核参数调优</h2><p>sysctl 用于查看和修改内核运行时参数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 查看所有参数&#10;sysctl -a&#10;&#10;# 查看特定参数&#10;sysctl vm.swappiness&#10;&#10;# 临时修改&#10;sysctl -w vm.swappiness=10&#10;&#10;# 永久修改（写入配置文件）&#10;echo &quot;vm.swappiness=10&quot; &gt;&gt; /etc/sysctl.conf&#10;sysctl -p\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看所有参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -a</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看特定参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vm.swappiness</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 临时修改</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> vm.swappiness=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 永久修改（写入配置文件）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"vm.swappiness=10\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /etc/sysctl.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sysctl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常用调优参数\">常用调优参数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vm.swappiness</td>\n<td>60</td>\n<td>Swap 倾向度（0=尽量不用，100=积极使用）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vm.dirty_ratio</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>脏页占内存比例超过此值时同步写入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>net.core.somaxconn</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>Socket 监听队列最大长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>net.ipv4.tcp_max_syn_backlog</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>SYN 队列最大长度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fs.file-max</td>\n<td>系统级</td>\n<td>系统最大打开文件数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>net.ipv4.ip_local_port_range</td>\n<td>32768-60999</td>\n<td>可用临时端口范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常用诊断工具速查\">常用诊断工具速查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>top / htop</td>\n<td>CPU 和内存实时监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vmstat</td>\n<td>虚拟内存、CPU、I/O 综合统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iostat</td>\n<td>磁盘 I/O 统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iotop</td>\n<td>按进程查看 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sar</td>\n<td>系统活动历史记录</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>perf</td>\n<td>CPU 性能剖析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>strace</td>\n<td>系统调用追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ltrace</td>\n<td>库函数调用追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>dmesg</td>\n<td>内核日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>journalctl</td>\n<td>systemd 日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lsof</td>\n<td>查看进程打开的文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ss</td>\n<td>Socket 统计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>性能调优首先要定位瓶颈所在：CPU、内存、磁盘 I/O 还是网络</li>\n<li><strong>top/htop</strong> 提供系统级实时监控，<strong>vmstat/iostat</strong> 提供详细统计</li>\n<li><strong>perf</strong> 是 CPU 性能剖析的标准工具，配合火焰图可视化调用栈</li>\n<li><strong>strace</strong> 追踪系统调用，是诊断程序行为异常的利器</li>\n<li><strong>sysctl</strong> 调整内核参数，根据工作负载特征优化系统配置</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"系统监控与性能调优","id":"系统监控与性能调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"性能分析方法论","id":"性能分析方法论"},{"level":2,"text":"CPU 监控","id":"cpu-监控"},{"level":3,"text":"top / htop","id":"top-htop"},{"level":3,"text":"负载（Load Average）","id":"负载-load-average"},{"level":2,"text":"内存监控","id":"内存监控"},{"level":2,"text":"磁盘 I/O 监控","id":"磁盘-i-o-监控"},{"level":2,"text":"perf — 性能剖析","id":"perf-性能剖析"},{"level":3,"text":"火焰图（Flame Graph）","id":"火焰图-flame-graph"},{"level":2,"text":"strace — 系统调用追踪","id":"strace-系统调用追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"sysctl — 内核参数调优","id":"sysctl-内核参数调优"},{"level":3,"text":"常用调优参数","id":"常用调优参数"},{"level":2,"text":"常用诊断工具速查","id":"常用诊断工具速查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Shell 与命令行工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/linux-practice/shell-and-cli"},"next":{"title":"容器技术原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/operating-system/linux-practice/container-internals"}}